#: scenario:scenario_2AFF8341_4A3E_430F_A1D6_31F2D481EF83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7922f39b98648dc17029e45cd3b8d3a9abd6ad3fca308a51825467a7975912cc
#. default-sha256: cbf81def6dc7ed196173bff451e090e8d5af482f00cbb9c85a70b812c0007728
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2AFF8341_4A3E_430F_A1D6_31F2D481EF83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The crestfallen young man faded into the distance, and the decrepit double doors "
"clacked shut."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫O jovem cabisbaixo desapareceu na distância, e as decrépitas portas duplas se fecharam."

#: scenario:scenario_43A49B46_7AAD_44A2_B999_45334FEA1E47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08ef148ca4ec4a38ea8c6a52cf1818f9bdfd9448e295ef0d5478c4120f14dd15
#. default-sha256: dfbc3e6c99e9aa0ee3b59a717c6fe453de107dd6555d636d0b5473e778a58368
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_43A49B46_7AAD_44A2_B999_45334FEA1E47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Through the shattered glass, ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫ could see only the ruins of a "
"garden, not a single rose growing within. ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You⟪k:6⟫He⟪k:7⟫ had evidently returned from "
"the past."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Através do vidro quebrado, ⟪k:1⟫Você⟪k:2⟫o Falecido⟪k:3⟫ podia ver apenas as ruínas de um "
"jardim, nem uma única rosa crescendo. ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Você⟪k:6⟫Ele⟪k:7⟫ tinha, evidentemente, retornado "
"do passado."

#: scenario:scenario_0FB3F01D_B617_4D13_8095_F4F8541039DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b0f0acfd534b4b6fd6cf7cfcc105bef211a111b5c4d07d6946e408091d4e6f18
#. default-sha256: 1a532a54ddbe3b3eceb7dce5e18f941dc2766ab7bc5bef0131848887779f3e6b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0FB3F01D_B617_4D13_8095_F4F8541039DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In the garden, weeds grew taller than people. ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫He⟪k:3⟫ found it difficult to "
"look at. ⟪k:4⟫A wolf howled in the distance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫No jardim, as ervas daninhas cresciam mais altas do que as pessoas. ⟪k:1⟫Você⟪k:2⟫Ele⟪k:3⟫ "
"achou difícil de olhar. ⟪k:4⟫Um lobo uivou ao longe."

#: scenario:scenario_93B40010_CB1F_4857_8A6C_0EE53963A89B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c62066557440f23fce294e9ace7a069694680bebdd1d6706c6d5bf7c51a50961
#. default-sha256: 91666c3ac24e5fc607caf055b5ce58e8b237e7a7e407ee0c8123e0b2704e54f2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_93B40010_CB1F_4857_8A6C_0EE53963A89B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The children, the sea of roses, and the White-Haired Girl were nowhere to be found."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫As crianças, o mar de rosas, e a Garota de Cabelos Brancos não estavam mais lá."

