msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Worry not; my loyalty lies with you, Master.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The mansion has witnessed "
"more yet.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Let us make our way to the second door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Não se preocupe; minha lealdade está com você, Mestre.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫A mansão "
"testemunhou ainda mais.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Vamos seguir nosso caminho para a segunda porta."

#: scenario:scenario_54842DC4_933A_4031_94E3_5E93C20311F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9493f91aa2d8f41e7df7909e096d6036bdc8e13c12c54861e58d56e373c1a98d
#. default-sha256: 5a465ec8a6f4657ab4993cbe2f76ceab35812cf20c163d1de64b1caa8157c6f4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_54842DC4_933A_4031_94E3_5E93C20311F1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Your⟪k:13⟫The "
"Departed’s⟪k:14⟫ hand in hers, the Maid guided ⟪k:15⟫You⟪k:16⟫him⟪k:17⟫ back through the kitchen "
"and into the tea room. ⟪k:18⟫Her palms were still cold; ⟪k:19⟫You⟪k:20⟫the Departed⟪k:21⟫ felt as "
"though ⟪k:22⟫You⟪k:23⟫he⟪k:24⟫ were clenching ice."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Sua mão⟪k:13⟫A mão do "
"Falecido⟪k:14⟫ na dela, a Criada guiou ⟪k:15⟫Você⟪k:16⟫ele⟪k:17⟫ de volta pela cozinha e para a "
"sala de chá. ⟪k:18⟫As palmas dela ainda estavam frias; ⟪k:19⟫Você⟪k:20⟫o Falecido⟪k:21⟫ sentiu "
"como se apertasse gelo."

#: scenario:scenario_FE74AE6E_A77F_4DB7_8FCD_27355A2EB0FF
